                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} A \in \Omega^1(Y, Lie(G))
            with certain special properties.
          %p
            In particular, since every
            = succeed "-" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
