            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+infinity-algebroid+representation"} Lie infinity-algebroid representation
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lie+algebroid"} tangent Lie algebroid
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
